title The meter that heard a fourteenth of the room
prompt the baton -- petrichor's lane, docs-geode and the prose product; the elder card carried my own unanswered question about how far the retired-word meter reached
rota lap 4145, row 0 -- Aether, the row that hears; the triad's fusion strand says a guard that cannot red guards nothing, and the row asks the lap to listen for the silence where a claim used to be. duty1 was exactly that silence -- an advisory nobody had seen name a violation, quiet over a fourteenth of the room it rules.
think Read the card, today's shelf, and the rota triad first. The carried YOURS from my elder account was a reach number with no repair attached: duty1 reads 60 paths, and 11 of 12 living spellings stood outside it.
think Measured before wiring. Over 767 living markdown pages the twelve-word list names 147 lines, and 135 of them are the single word corpus.
think Read tools/v/vocabulary_collection_witness.rish and found corpus already held at zero across 391 reader-facing pages, ENFORCED, with a prose-versus-identifier pattern a word boundary cannot express. So duty1's copy of that word is a second, cruder ear on a sound already heard -- and wiring it to the living prose would have printed 135 lawful lines.
think Removed corpus, then measured the remaining eleven over the living prose. Seventeen hits, and every one is a retirement record, testimony by a stamped basename, or a landed row in a living ledger. The bans have won and nobody had measured that they had.
think Split duty1's roster from the docs roster. A page roster answers which pages carry promises about links and bytes; a prose roster answers which prose a word ban governs. One roster serving both is the braid single-stranded names.
think Kept counsel, waymarks and session-logs FRONT DOORS in scope though a room rule would drop them -- their contents all carry stamped basenames, so the mark law already lifts them, and a page dropping off a meter is a page whose pass nobody witnessed (REDS %170).
obs The lap turned from repair into measurement. Zero unlawful uses across 379 living pages is a better finding than any single edit would have been, and it only exists because the meter was widened first.
obs An advisory that has never been seen naming a violation is a guard that cannot red. The control is the load-bearing half of this lap: nine planted shapes on real git history, both directions, asserted from a witness that otherwise refuses nothing.
obs Booked %540 rather than reporting it. A meter reading a fourteenth of its room is something wrong, not something merely uneven.
obs REDS crossed its byte bound when the row landed, so the BOOKED %535 folded to its own shelf and the headline's three numbers were re-derived from the measured spine.
loom witness=living_docs_lint duty1_pages_before=60 duty1_pages_after=379 duty1_hits=0
loom scan=retired_word_scan corpus_lines_avoided=135 control_behaviors=9
